Project notes for Codex

- Instagram portfolio media is fetched with the server-side IG_TOKEN environment variable.
- Meta webhook verification is handled by /api/instagram/webhook.
- The webhook verify token must be configured as IG_WEBHOOK_VERIFY_TOKEN in local and Vercel environments.
- The scheduled GitHub Action refreshes IG_TOKEN in Vercel production on the 1st and 15th of each month.
- GitHub Actions requires repository secrets VERCEL_TOKEN and IG_TOKEN.
- GitHub Actions requires repository variables VERCEL_ORG_ID and VERCEL_PROJECT_ID.
- Do not commit real access tokens, Vercel OIDC tokens, or .env files.
